1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,160
San Mateo, Kapitulo 12

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,840
Saan niyo kadi anabasa iti inaramid ni David?

3
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:39,840
Idi iso kandag iti tattao na nagbisinda?

4
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:42,080
Insumbat ni Jesus,

5
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:44,080
Simrek ni David,

6
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:46,640
kandag iti kadwana iti balay iti Diyos,

7
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:50,300
kat kinanda iti tinapay anaidaton iti Diyos.

8
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:54,220
Maisalungasing iti lintag iti inaramid na,

9
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:59,160
tadag iti laang papaditi mapalubusan amangan iti dayta at tinapay.

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,740
O eno, diyo ay anabasa iti lintag ni Moises nga iti aldaw apanaginana?

11
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:10,560
Saan amakabasol dagiti papadi iti unag ti templo,

12
00:01:11,220 --> 00:01:14,080
nupay salungasingin dati lintag iti panaginana?

13
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:20,380
Ibagak kada kayo na adaditoy ti Maisa anang nangruna ngam ti templo.

14
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:22,940
Kunatinasantuan asurat,

15
00:01:24,520 --> 00:01:26,160
Asi tikalikagumak,

16
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,900
saan adaton amapuuran?

17
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,020
Noagpayso nga amuyo iti kaipapanandaytoy,

18
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:36,900
diyo kumaukumendag iti awanbasol na,

19
00:01:37,820 --> 00:01:39,700
agsipod tatianak iti tao,

20
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:43,120
iso iti apu ti aldaw apanaginana.

21
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:46,180
Pimanaw ni Jesus iti dayta alugar,

22
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,140
kat napan iti sinagoga,

23
00:01:48,860 --> 00:01:52,840
at dalalaki sa djay aparalitiko iti Maisa nga imana,

24
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:56,460
kat gapo takayat iti sumagmamano at ataos sa djay

25
00:01:56,460 --> 00:01:59,400
na idarom ni Jesus sinaludsodda.

26
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,840
Iparit aya ti linteg tayo iti panangagas iti aldaw apanaginana?

27
00:02:05,540 --> 00:02:07,340
Kinunan ni Jesus kada kuwada,

28
00:02:08,040 --> 00:02:11,240
Kas pangaringan, iti aldaw apanaginana,

29
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:15,460
ti karnero ti Maisa kada kayo matnag iti abot.

30
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,660
Di na aya alain ken aunan,

31
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:22,580
napatpatag nga dayo ti tao ngam ti karnero.

32
00:02:23,460 --> 00:02:25,680
Isotga po nga ipalubos ti linteg,

33
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,880
iti panagaramid iti naimbang,

34
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:29,860
iti aldaw apanaginana.

35
00:02:30,580 --> 00:02:32,940
Kinunangarod ni Jesus iti lalaki,

36
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:37,800
Inunat ti lalaki iti imana,

37
00:02:38,300 --> 00:02:41,000
kit imimbag akas iti Maisa nga imana.

38
00:02:41,740 --> 00:02:44,340
Pimanaw dagit ti Farisyo tatnotulaganda

39
00:02:44,340 --> 00:02:47,100
nukasanuti panang papatayda kini Jesus.

40
00:02:47,980 --> 00:02:50,680
Idinaamuan ni Jesus ti gandat dagit ti Farisyo,

41
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:52,200
pimanaw sa djay.

42
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:55,700
Simurot kinkwana dagit ti aduo at at tao,

43
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:58,300
inagasan na amin dagit ti masakit,

44
00:02:58,880 --> 00:02:59,920
binilin na idang,

45
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,920
naawan pangibagbagaanda iti maipapan kinkwana,

46
00:03:03,460 --> 00:03:05,520
tap numatumpal ti kinunati Diyos,

47
00:03:05,660 --> 00:03:07,700
babaen kini Profeta Isayas.

48
00:03:09,580 --> 00:03:10,200
At ito ay pinili,

49
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:13,140
ito ay ayatek ken pakaiwak unay,

50
00:03:13,740 --> 00:03:15,920
ito ay kuntot espiritok kinkwana,

51
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:21,500
kit ipakaamuanan to kadagit amin at at tao ti yaay ti tsyempo ti ustisya.

52
00:03:22,380 --> 00:03:26,000
Ngayon din to makisupyat wino agpukaw karitikal kalsada,

53
00:03:26,780 --> 00:03:28,860
kit din to makatitiling titimeg na.

54
00:03:28,860 --> 00:03:36,020
Dinan tutokkulin tinaparpar aruno wino idepen tila kukuridimdem asilaw,

55
00:03:36,820 --> 00:03:41,560
saan to ngagsardeng aging gaitidina mapagbaligi ti kinalinteg,

56
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:46,280
kit mangnamnaman to kinkwana dagit ti amin at at tao.

57
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:47,900
Kalpasan na,

58
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:53,120
impan ti sumagmamano at at tao kini Jesus ti may saalalaki abulsek,

59
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:54,160
kin umel,

60
00:03:54,620 --> 00:03:56,720
agsepod talinuganan ti demonyo.

61
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,200
Pinaimbag ni Jesus,

62
00:03:58,200 --> 00:03:59,380
dito'y alalaki,

63
00:03:59,900 --> 00:04:03,100
kit itikasta makasaokin makakitan,

64
00:04:03,740 --> 00:04:06,980
nas daaw amin dagit itataw itiinaramin ni Jesus.

65
00:04:07,860 --> 00:04:10,420
Saan nga tanga iso dito'y tianak ni David?

66
00:04:11,180 --> 00:04:12,180
Sinalud-sudda,

67
00:04:12,700 --> 00:04:15,200
idinanged dito'y dagit ti farisyo kinunada.

68
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:18,320
Paksiyaten na dagit ti demonyo,

69
00:04:18,900 --> 00:04:22,420
gapulang itipan na kabalin ngayon tedkin kwanan ni Bilsibub,

70
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,600
a prinsipe dagit ti demonyo.

71
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:27,380
Amo ni Jesus tipampanunutunda,

72
00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:29,380
kit kinunana kadakwada.

73
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:31,880
Saan nga agbayag ti pagarian

74
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:33,300
ama bingay-bingay

75
00:04:33,300 --> 00:04:35,440
kin agigin no batmetlaeng?

76
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:38,000
Anyaman nga ili,

77
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:40,500
wen no familia ama bingay-bingay

78
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:41,600
kin agigin nura.

79
00:04:42,660 --> 00:04:43,600
Dinto agpawot.

80
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:47,560
No agbibinusur dagit ipasurot ni satanas,

81
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:51,000
kasano ama taginayon ti pagarian na?

82
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:54,380
Kunayo apaksyatek dagit ti demonyo,

83
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:57,180
gaputa ikanak ni Bilsibub itipan na kasi,

84
00:04:57,180 --> 00:04:59,220
pan nakabalin amang aramid itikasta.

85
00:05:00,900 --> 00:05:04,360
Sinungarod ti mangted kadagit ipasurot yu itipan nakabalin

86
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:06,500
amang paksyat kadagit ti demonyo.

87
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,500
Kinapudnuna,

88
00:05:09,740 --> 00:05:13,380
ti espiritu ti Diyos ti mangted kanyak itipan nakabalin

89
00:05:13,380 --> 00:05:15,860
amang paksyat kadagit ti demonyo.

90
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:19,740
Dahito itimang panagnag nga adan kadakayo

91
00:05:19,740 --> 00:05:21,740
ti pagarian ti Diyos.

92
00:05:22,540 --> 00:05:25,560
Awan ti makastrek itibalay tinapig sa atao,

93
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,140
tap no alaan na,

94
00:05:27,180 --> 00:05:28,260
dagit ti kukuwana.

95
00:05:29,340 --> 00:05:31,900
Reputan na pa yung umunatin na pig sa atao

96
00:05:31,900 --> 00:05:34,380
sa agsam-sam itiunag tibalay.

97
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:37,520
Ti saan amakikado kanyak?

98
00:05:38,820 --> 00:05:39,560
Busurin nak.

99
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:43,100
Ti saan atumulong kanyak na agurnong?

100
00:05:44,260 --> 00:05:44,860
Agiwara.

101
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:48,200
Dahito itigapunang ibagak kadakayo.

102
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:51,940
Mapakawan ti siya sinuman amakabasol

103
00:05:51,940 --> 00:05:54,300
wen no agsao iti kinadakas.

104
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:56,700
Ngayon din ito mapakawan ti agsao

105
00:05:57,180 --> 00:05:59,560
iti maibusur iti Espiritu Santo.

106
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:04,120
Mapakawan ti agsao iti maikontra iti anak ti tao.

107
00:06:05,100 --> 00:06:07,360
Ngayon saan amapakawan ti agsao

108
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:10,260
iti maibusur iti Espiritu Santo.

109
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:12,320
Iti tayo ti abyag

110
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:14,820
wen no iti masakbayan.

111
00:06:15,660 --> 00:06:17,140
No nasayaat ti kayo,

112
00:06:18,140 --> 00:06:20,280
agbunga iti nasayaat.

113
00:06:21,020 --> 00:06:23,400
No saan anasayaat ti kayo,

114
00:06:24,540 --> 00:06:26,500
saan anasayaat ti bunga na?

115
00:06:27,180 --> 00:06:30,300
Tama ilasin ti kayo kapo iti bunga na.

116
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:33,080
Dakayo akapototan ti ulag.

117
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:36,320
Kasanuti pa nagsaoyo iti naimbag,

118
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:38,260
idinto at dakas kayo.

119
00:06:39,100 --> 00:06:40,560
Taisawang tingiwat,

120
00:06:41,060 --> 00:06:42,560
tilinaon ti puso.

121
00:06:43,380 --> 00:06:45,000
Irwarte naimbag at tao

122
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,040
dagiti naimbag nga iduldulin na.

123
00:06:47,980 --> 00:06:49,800
Irwarte dakas at tao

124
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,860
dagiti dakas nga iduldulin na.

125
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,160
Ibagak kadakayo.

126
00:06:54,980 --> 00:06:56,720
Ngayon tunaldaw apanangukom.

127
00:06:57,180 --> 00:06:59,680
Kung batang ito titunggal may

128
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:00,960
sa dagiti awan sirsir

129
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:02,220
binang nga insawang na.

130
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,140
Tadagitin ito sa om

131
00:07:04,140 --> 00:07:05,780
tipakaukumam metlaeng.

132
00:07:06,540 --> 00:07:07,620
No nakabasol ka,

133
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,220
wen no saan?

134
00:07:09,940 --> 00:07:11,380
Nagsaot ito magmamano

135
00:07:11,380 --> 00:07:13,040
ama maestro itilinteg

136
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:15,200
ken sumagmamano a farisyo.

137
00:07:15,940 --> 00:07:16,620
Maestro?

138
00:07:17,460 --> 00:07:18,060
Kinunada?

139
00:07:18,900 --> 00:07:21,080
Ipakitaan na kami man iti milagro.

140
00:07:21,860 --> 00:07:23,560
Anyan anagdakas

141
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:25,160
dagiti tataw ka dagito

142
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:25,760
ng aldaw.

143
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:28,840
Awan pamatida iti Diyos.

144
00:07:29,620 --> 00:07:30,860
Insungbat ni Jesus.

145
00:07:31,820 --> 00:07:33,760
Agdawat kayo iti milagro.

146
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:35,820
Awan iti maipakita

147
00:07:35,820 --> 00:07:36,360
kadakayo.

148
00:07:37,180 --> 00:07:38,480
Nudila ang iti milagro

149
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,860
ni profeta Honas.

150
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:42,380
Kas iti panagyan ni Honas

151
00:07:42,380 --> 00:07:44,120
iti tiyan iti dakkal nga ikan

152
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:46,300
iti lasod iti talungal daw

153
00:07:46,300 --> 00:07:47,060
ken rabi.

154
00:07:47,540 --> 00:07:49,560
Kas tantumot iti panagyan

155
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,560
iti anak iti tao

156
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,140
iti unag iti daga.

157
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:54,540
Intunaldaw apanangukom.

158
00:07:54,540 --> 00:07:56,500
Tumakderto dagiti

159
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:58,340
taga ni Nefi amang pabasol

160
00:07:58,340 --> 00:07:58,840
kadakayo.

161
00:07:59,620 --> 00:08:02,180
Tanagbabawida kadagiti basbasolda

162
00:08:02,180 --> 00:08:03,960
idinang ngagdati pa ng

163
00:08:03,960 --> 00:08:05,280
kaskasaba ni Honas.

164
00:08:06,260 --> 00:08:07,260
Ibagak kadakayo.

165
00:08:08,020 --> 00:08:10,420
Ngaaddadito iti may sa anatantanok

166
00:08:10,420 --> 00:08:11,760
ngam ni Honas.

167
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:14,100
Intunaldaw apanangukom.

168
00:08:14,820 --> 00:08:16,100
Tumakderto tirena

169
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:17,260
at agaabagatan

170
00:08:17,260 --> 00:08:18,960
amang idarong kadakayo.

171
00:08:19,780 --> 00:08:22,240
Agsipod tanagdalyas at iti adayo

172
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:24,380
alugar. Tapno umay nala

173
00:08:24,380 --> 00:08:26,500
ang dunggan tinainsiriban

174
00:08:26,500 --> 00:08:28,060
apan nursuro ni Solomon.

175
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,260
Ibagak kadakayo

176
00:08:30,260 --> 00:08:32,540
ngaaddadito iti may sa

177
00:08:32,540 --> 00:08:34,920
anatantanok ngam ni Solomon.

178
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,240
Nurumuartidakas

179
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:39,320
nga espiritu iti may sa atao.

180
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:41,340
Mapanagsursor

181
00:08:41,340 --> 00:08:42,480
kadagiti luglugar

182
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,420
anamaga ngagsapol

183
00:08:44,420 --> 00:08:45,640
iti paginanaan na.

184
00:08:46,340 --> 00:08:47,920
Nuawan iti masapulan na

185
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:49,840
kunan na itinakam na.

186
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:52,300
Agsubliak itibalay ko.

187
00:08:53,060 --> 00:08:54,040
Agsublingarod.

188
00:08:54,380 --> 00:08:56,160
Ket masarakan na tibalay

189
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:57,240
ngaawan na gyan na.

190
00:08:57,960 --> 00:09:00,280
Nadalus, ken, natarimaan.

191
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:01,760
Itikasta.

192
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,300
Rumuar.

193
00:09:03,900 --> 00:09:05,680
Ket mangisampet itipitong

194
00:09:05,680 --> 00:09:08,100
espiritu at dakdakes paingam iso.

195
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,280
Ket kadwa na idangag

196
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:11,140
daid sa jay.

197
00:09:11,940 --> 00:09:14,100
Ngarod. Dakdakes to

198
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:15,640
tika sasaad dayta atao

199
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:16,860
ngam iti imuna.

200
00:09:17,780 --> 00:09:19,320
Kasto'y tumit tipagbanagan

201
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,980
nagiti dakis ata tao

202
00:09:20,980 --> 00:09:23,040
iti daytoy akapututan.

203
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,920
Madama pa'y laing

204
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:27,320
nagsasaw ni Jesus kadagiti tattao

205
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:29,300
idis sumangpet ni ina na

206
00:09:29,300 --> 00:09:31,440
ken dagiti kakabsat na alalaki

207
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:33,020
nagyan da itiruar

208
00:09:33,020 --> 00:09:34,860
ket kayat dati makisao

209
00:09:34,860 --> 00:09:35,660
kin ni Jesus.

210
00:09:36,500 --> 00:09:38,360
Ngim insungbat na ititao

211
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,780
anang ibaga kin kuwana.

212
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:41,940
Siya sino kaditi inak?

213
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:44,640
Siya sino kadit dagiti kakabsat ko?

214
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:46,700
Ket intudo ni Jesus

215
00:09:46,700 --> 00:09:48,920
dagiti adalan na sana kinuna.

216
00:09:49,660 --> 00:09:50,360
Kitaan nyo.

217
00:09:50,940 --> 00:09:52,160
Daytoy ti inak

218
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:52,360
ken dagiti ina.

219
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:53,860
Ti kakabsat ko.

220
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:57,360
Ti siya sino man niya agaramit itipagayatan ni amak

221
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,360
sa dilangit.

222
00:09:58,700 --> 00:09:59,800
Iso ti kabsat ko.

223
00:10:00,340 --> 00:10:01,180
Ken ti inak.

